# FoodWaste360 - environment variables (example file)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` if you ever need secrets, and NEVER commit `.env`
# to version control.
#
# Version 1 of FoodWaste360 does not use any external API and therefore
# needs no secrets. If an AI/API integration is added later, put its key
# here and load it in code with `os.environ["..."]` - never hard-code keys
# in the source files.

# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...        # example for a future optional AI feature
